A compact update rule makes the recurrence visible: $\begin{aligned}
C_{n+1} &= E_n,\\
E_{n+1} &= f(C_{n+1}).\end{aligned}$ In this notation $C$ means cause and $E$ means effect. The function $f$ is only a schematic placeholder for what follows from. Nothing in the transcript warrants a formal causal calculus. The notation simply preserves the lecture’s warning: an explanatory chain can be extended indefinitely while the fact remains untouched.

